[[Maul]] had a '''lair''' located in a [[cave]] beneath the surface of the [[planet]] [[Lotho Minor]].<ref name="Brothers" /> After his [[Battle of Naboo|defeat]] at the hands of [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]],<ref name="Episode I">{{Film|I}}</ref> Maul lived in a cave that he made into his lair on the junk world of Lotho Minor until his brother [[Savage Opress]] found him.<ref name="Brothers" />

